# --- scratch guard -------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is a public GitHub Pages site. Jekyll copies unknown top-level
# folders into _site and jekyll-sitemap indexes them, so anything dropped
# here gets published AND submitted to search engines.
#
# Personal material has landed here twice (an immigration petition in
# 2026-07, a resume + confidential peer-review material in 2026-08). These
# patterns exist so a stray `git add -A` can't publish the next one.
# Keep them in sync with `exclude:` in _config.yml.
tmp/
output/
outputs/
work/
deliverables/
tools/
.codex_review/
.codex-resume-work/
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
